# The objects of the map besides the cities, the new buildings, the headquarters of the intelligence and the secret actions of the ambassadors.

rumc-city-capability-deposit = Deposit: whatever is built here brings in twice as much money.

rumc-site-deepmine-name = Deep Mine
rumc-site-deepmine-desc = A mine that has gone kilometres under the ground. There is ore for decades here, and almost no guards.
rumc-site-oilfield-name = Oil Field
rumc-site-oilfield-desc = Rows of pumps in the middle of the wasteland. Black gold is worth more than water here.
rumc-site-saltflats-name = Salt Flats
rumc-site-saltflats-desc = A white plain where salt has been mined since forever. Without it no food on the continent is salted.
rumc-site-quarry-name = Hard Quarry
rumc-site-quarry-desc = A huge pit. Stone for the walls of all the cities round about is carried from here.
rumc-site-farmstead-name = Green Ravine Farmstead
rumc-site-farmstead-desc = A fertile valley of farms. Grain and vegetables from here feed half the world.
rumc-site-hotsprings-name = Warm Springs
rumc-site-hotsprings-desc = Hot springs with healing water. The sick and the rich come here, and rumours and money come with them.
rumc-site-radiorelay-name = Beacon-7 Radio Relay
rumc-site-radiorelay-desc = An old long-range tower. Half the talks of the region go through it, and whoever holds it hears everything.
rumc-site-observatory-name = Starlit Observatory
rumc-site-observatory-desc = A high-mountain observatory. The scholars look not only at the stars but at what goes on in the valleys.
rumc-site-watchfort-name = Watch Fort
rumc-site-watchfort-desc = A stone fort on a pass. The garrison takes a toll and readily sells the surplus of its arsenal.
rumc-site-oldbunker-name = Old Bunker
rumc-site-oldbunker-desc = A pre-war bunker with untouched stores. What is left in them only those who went down know.
rumc-site-crossroads-name = Seven Roads Crossing
rumc-site-crossroads-desc = An inn where the caravan roads cross. Traders stop here, and the prices are fair.
rumc-site-ruins-name = Old City Ruins
rumc-site-ruins-desc = The remains of a huge city from before the catastrophe. People dig here for treasure and trade what they find without questions.
rumc-site-crashsite-name = Crash Site
rumc-site-crashsite-desc = The wreck of a freighter that fell many years ago. The looters took all that was worth taking long ago, but not everything.
rumc-site-smugglercove-name = Smugglers Cove
rumc-site-smugglercove-desc = A bay hidden from strangers eyes. Ships that are in no port's books tie up here.
rumc-site-lighthouse-name = Lonely Lighthouse
rumc-site-lighthouse-desc = A lighthouse on the rocks. The keeper sees every ship and writes down all that he sees.
rumc-site-fishery-name = Herring Fishing Village
rumc-site-fishery-desc = A fishermen's guild on the shore. The catch is salted and sent to the cities, and the money is shared fairly.

rumc-action-watchtower-name = Watchtower
rumc-action-watchtower-desc = A lookout on an object of the map. While it stands, raids on the place do not happen. It is built only on objects, not in cities.
rumc-action-outpost-name = Outpost
rumc-action-outpost-desc = A fortified post with a garrison. Keeps raids and cave-ins away from the object and wins the favour of the locals. It is built only on objects.
rumc-action-workcamp-name = Work Camp
rumc-action-workcamp-desc = A camp of workers on an object of the map. It brings money to the budget, and twice as much on a deposit. It is built only on objects.
rumc-action-fieldhospital-name = Field Hospital
rumc-action-fieldhospital-desc = The tents of the doctors on an object of the map. They keep epidemics away from the place. It is built only on objects.
rumc-action-intelhq-name = Intelligence Headquarters
rumc-action-intelhq-desc = A secret building that a faction can have only one of. It lets the faction send scouts into cities and objects, do harm to the other ambassadors in secret (discredit, sabotage, provocation) and turn counter-intelligence on.

rumc-map-only-cities = This building is built only in cities.
rumc-map-only-sites = This building is built only on objects of the map, not in cities.
rumc-map-unique = Your faction already has such a building, there cannot be a second.

rumc-map-hq-needed = A built headquarters of the intelligence is needed.
rumc-map-hq-title = Intelligence headquarters
rumc-map-hq-hint = Scouts and secret actions. The secret actions share the pause of the sorties: one at a time, then a wait.
