rumc-action-jointmarket-name = Shared Market (two)
rumc-action-jointmarket-desc = A fair where both trade. It brings in money for both while both keep influence of 20 in the city. It is built only in cities.
rumc-action-jointgranary-name = Shared Granary (two)
rumc-action-jointgranary-desc = A store for two. It takes a famine, a drought or an epidemic on itself (three times) and both get the influence for it. It is built anywhere.
rumc-action-jointfort-name = Shared Fort (two)
rumc-action-jointfort-desc = A fort with a common garrison. It holds raids, cave-ins and fires away from the object and brings both a little money. It is built only on objects.
rumc-action-jointmine-name = Shared Mine (two)
rumc-action-jointmine-desc = A mine worked by two. The biggest income of the joint works, and twice that on a deposit. It is built only on objects.
rumc-action-jointacademy-name = Shared Academy (two)
rumc-action-jointacademy-desc = An academy of two factions. It keeps epidemics away from the city, brings in money and, every 15 minutes, a point of influence with the mother faction to each. Dear. It is built only in cities.
